{"id":"7fc1c92fbb0e274b","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-topo10-quotient-topology-open.md","title":"ZFC Topo10 Quotient Topology Open","display":"df-zfc-topo10-quotient-topology-open — ZFC Topo10 Quotient Topology Open","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo10-quotient-topology-open","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo10-quotient-topology-open"],"display":"df-zfc-topo10-quotient-topology-open — ZFC Topo10 Quotient Topology Open","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo10-quotient-topology-open"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo10-quotient-topology-open</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo10-quotient-topology-open — ZFC Topo10 Quotient Topology Open"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdeb0db348e01893\" href=\"?note=fdeb0db348e01893\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,X,Y,\\tau,U,\\tau_Y\\in V\">\\(q,X,Y,\\tau,U,\\tau_Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S\\)</span>（商拓扑谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fdeb0db348e01893\" href=\"?note=fdeb0db348e01893\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10QuotientTopologyOpen}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10QuotientTopologyOpen}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（本原子定义的谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}topology\\text{-}open}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10QuotientTopologyOpen}_S(U,Y,X,\\tau,q)\\leftrightarrow Y=\\operatorname{ran}(q)\\land U\\subseteq Y\\land\\exists\\tau_Y\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S(\\tau_Y,q,X,\\tau)\\land U\\in\\tau_Y\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}topology\\text{-}open}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10QuotientTopologyOpen}_S(U,Y,X,\\tau,q)\\leftrightarrow Y=\\operatorname{ran}(q)\\land U\\subseteq Y\\land\\exists\\tau_Y\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S(\\tau_Y,q,X,\\tau)\\land U\\in\\tau_Y\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>商空间载体固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(q)\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(q)\\)</span>；上游商拓扑谓词同时验证源拓扑、函数性及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(q)=X\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(q)=X\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>因而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 开当且仅当其属于由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q^{-1}[U]\\in\\tau\">\\(q^{-1}[U]\\in\\tau\\)</span> 定义的商拓扑；这里不用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>，以免与全局集合论宇宙混淆。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"fdeb0db348e01893","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"fdeb0db348e01893","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S$（商拓扑谓词，见 [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"q,X,Y,\\tau,U,\\tau_Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10QuotientTopologyOpen}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}topology\\text{-}open}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10QuotientTopologyOpen}_S(U,Y,X,\\tau,q)\\leftrightarrow Y=\\operatorname{ran}(q)\\land U\\subseteq Y\\land\\exists\\tau_Y\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S(\\tau_Y,q,X,\\tau)\\land U\\in\\tau_Y\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(q)=X","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"q^{-1}[U]\\in\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1296,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3670","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-topo10-quotient-topology-open.md|58-df-zfc-topo10-quotient-topology-open]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","fdeb0db348e01893"]}